OL,3,GNEWSAImmigration centre inquiry faces
OL,4,Agovernment delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public planning inquiry into
OL,7,Fproposals to expand the Haslar
OL,8,FImmigration removal centre (IRC) in
OL,9,FGosport is due to open today.
OL,11,FLast week the government announced that
OL,12,Fsome evidence presented by the Home
OL,13,FOffice might be given behind closed
OL,14,Fdoors as a result of national security
OL,15,Fconcerns at a date yet to be confirmed.
OL,17,FThe existing centre, which closed in
OL,18,F2015, is currently being redeveloped.
OL,19,FThe proposed expansion would see four
OL,20,Fnew accommodation blocks for
OL,21,Findividuals with no lawful right to
OL,22,Fremain in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
